%% ---------------------------------------------------------------------
%% Figure 14: State Machine Diagram — Task Lifecycle
%% SRS source: SRS §11.9 FR-09.2; §16 task_assignments
%% ---------------------------------------------------------------------
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Assigned : teacher assigns task (FR-09.2)
    Assigned --> InProgress : student opens experiment
    InProgress --> Completed : quiz passed at 80 percent or above (FR-04.3)
    Assigned --> Overdue : due date reached
    InProgress --> Overdue : due date reached
    Overdue --> Completed : late completion
    Completed --> [*]


%% ---------------------------------------------------------------------
%% Figure 15: State Machine Diagram — Safety Certification
%% SRS source: SRS §11.2 FR-02.1, FR-02.2; §14 DR-02, DR-05; §15 IR-02, IR-10
%% ---------------------------------------------------------------------
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Uncertified
    Uncertified --> Tier1Passed : tier 1 score at least 80 percent
    Tier1Passed --> Tier2Passed : tier 2 score at least 80 percent
    Tier2Passed --> Tier3Passed : tier 3 score at least 80 percent
    Tier3Passed --> Certified : tier 4 score at least 80 percent / issue certificate
    Uncertified --> Uncertified : score below 80 percent / retry
    Tier1Passed --> Tier1Passed : score below 80 percent / retry
    Tier2Passed --> Tier2Passed : score below 80 percent / retry
    Tier3Passed --> Tier3Passed : score below 80 percent / retry
    Certified --> [*]

    note right of Certified
        DR-02: 80 percent threshold is fixed policy
        IR-10: no certificate if any tier below 80 percent
        DR-05: issued certificates are never deleted
    end note


